Z||000017||Standard||01-24-2001||12:27 AM||||Yep, that's what he did.  I think there's a write-up somewhere on the website.<P>------------------<BR>Everybody wants a normal life and a cool car.. <B>Most people settle for the car</B><P>I'm not dumb.  I just have a command of thoroughly useless information        <BR>AOL: LastMinuteBastrd<BR>AIM: Standard88||||reg||14
