Z||000019||lawrence||01-24-2001||03:45 PM||||Yes, I made it.  I took a spare nose, turned it upside down, and mounted it to the bottom of the car.  I don't have a write-up per se, but there is a little more detail here:<P> <A HREF="http://www.webelectricmagazine.com/99/1/tte.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.webelectricmagazine.com/99/1/tte.htm</A> <P>If you need more info, just ask.<P>Good luck,<P>-L<BR> <A HREF="http://www.webelectricmagazine.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.webelectricmagazine.com</A> <BR> <A HREF="http://members.nccw.net/webe/products" TARGET=_blank>http://members.nccw.net/webe/products</A> ||||reg||1
